    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1dd12a2b-3eff-4e59-b7cb-4231f1e9f7b9-01/AccessTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1TenderDocumentRef-LOT-0001>,
    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/1dd12a2b-3eff-4e59-b7cb-4231f1e9f7b9-01/FrameworkAgreementTerm$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingProcess1>,
